/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find_2\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a wall in the entrance area of <a href=\"/wiki/Philgrave%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Philgrave's Mansion\">Philgrave's Mansion</a></li>\n<li>On a wall in <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item has a slightly different ingame model when compared to the more common regular version.</li>\n<li>Upon closer inspection, the painting in fact depicts a woman spinning yarn.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062900\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2054/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25657/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7115/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932651/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.356      1 -total\n 99.89%   48.304      2 Template:Misc_item_page\n 45.94%   22.214      9 Template:Icon_text\n 38.64%   18.685     19 Template:Trim\n 17.88%    8.648      1 Template:Uid\n 15.40%    7.449      4 Template:Hidden_code\n 15.00%    7.254      2 Template:PageSeo\n 14.19%    6.863      2 Template:Main_only\n 11.17%    5.400      1 Template:Template_style\n 11.15%    5.391      2 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Sa